Z||000001||Archie||12-10-2001||09:20 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KRMFiero:<BR><B>thinking about converting from Auto to 5 speed, question is my local junk yard has a 84/85 4 speed fiero with everything, i dont want a 4 speed, i want a 5 speed, i can get parts from this car cheap, what can i use from this car for my conversion? are all master cylinders the same? clutch line? anythign else? shifter assymbally?<P>Kyle</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You can use the pedal assy, all the hyd. parts (master cyl, hyd. line and slave cyl.), you can use the axles. <P>If you are swapping to a 5 speed you can't use the shifter and shift cables.<P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
